    {"id":"opendoor","tags":["open"],"from":"canticles","name":"Canticle of the Open Door","roll":"","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"close","use":"Action","does":"You sing the first line of a hymn backwards, and the fastening gives. One lock, door, lid or seal you touch opens. No check. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails."},
    {"id":"unbinding","tags":["open"],"from":"canticles","name":"Unbinding","roll":"","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"near","use":"Action","does":"You read the words of release aloud, and knots slip and iron loosens. Chains, ropes, shackles and wards fall away from one creature in Near. No check. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails."},
    {"id":"openwound","from":"canticles","name":"Open Wound","roll":"WIS","effort":10,"cat":"magic","horror":1,"band":"near","use":"Action","does":"You name every hurt a creature has ever suffered, and each one remembers itself. Make a WIS check against the scene Target against one creature in Near; on a success its old wounds open at once for Magic Effort d10 damage. Adds 1 Horror, hit or miss.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"damage","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails."},
    {"id":"lastverse","from":"thresholdlectionary","name":"The Last Verse","roll":"","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"near","use":"Action","does":"You read the closing verse of a sealed rite, and a crack opens in a binding. Something comes through. It owes you nothing and it is not your servant; the GM decides what it is and what it wants. No check. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails."},
    {"id":"emberpsalm","from":"cinderlectionary","name":"Ember Psalm","roll":"INT","effort":10,"cat":"magic","horror":1,"band":"far","use":"Action","does":"You sing a line of the Cinder Lectionary, and holy fire gathers in your fist. Make an INT check against the scene Target to burn one creature you can see in Near or Far; on a success roll Magic Effort d10 fire damage. This fire burns flesh alone: cloth, wood and paper beside it stay unmarked. Adds 1 Horror, hit or miss.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"damage","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails."},
    {"id":"pillarash","tags":["hide"],"from":"embers","name":"Pillar of Ash","roll":"","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"near","use":"Action","does":"Grey ash pours from your mouth and sleeves and will not stop. It fills the room you are in. Until it settles, nobody inside can see past arm’s length, and it catches in every throat. No check. The GM decides when it settles. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails."},
    {"id":"psalmruin","tags":["open"],"from":"cinderlectionary","name":"Psalm of Ruin","roll":"","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"far","use":"Action","does":"You chant the psalm the masons fear, and stone and timber crack. One wall, floor, roof or bridge within Far that you can see collapses. No check. Anyone on it or under it is in danger; the GM decides what falls where. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails."},
    {"id":"pyre","from":"cinderlectionary","name":"Pyre","roll":"INT","effort":12,"cat":"ultimate","horror":1,"band":"near","use":"Action","does":"You fix your eyes on a creature and it begins to burn from within: smoke at the mouth, light behind the eyes. Make an INT check against the scene Target against one creature in Close or Near; on a success roll Ultimate Effort d12 damage. Adds 1 Horror, hit or miss.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"damage","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails."},
    {"id":"watchingpage","tags":["learn"],"from":"untitled","name":"The Page That Watches","roll":"","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"self","use":"Action","does":"You open the book on the ground where you stand, and a page looks back. Learn one true thing about this place: something that happened here, something hidden here, or something waiting here. The GM chooses which. No check. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails."},
    {"id":"borrowedface","tags":["hide"],"needs":"obstacle","from":"untitled","name":"Borrowed Face","roll":"","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"self","use":"Action","does":"You draw a dead stranger’s face over your own. Until dawn you wear the face and voice of someone you have seen die. You do not gain their memories, and the GM decides who is fooled. No check. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails."},
    {"id":"doorinward","tags":["move"],"from":"untitled","name":"The Door Inward","roll":"","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"near","use":"Action","does":"You step into one shadow and out of another you can see within Near, as if through a door left open for you. Only what you carry comes with you. No check. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails."},
    {"id":"realname","from":"thresholdlectionary","name":"Its Real Name","roll":"","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"special","use":"Action","does":"You speak the book’s true name aloud. The GM decides what it does, and it is never small. No check. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails."},
    {"id":"rimespear","name":"Spear of Rime","roll":"INT","effort":10,"horror":1,"band":"far","use":"Action","does":"Frost runs up your arm and leaves your hand as a spear of grey ice. Make an INT check against the scene Target to strike one foe in Near or Far. On success roll Magic Effort d10 for damage. The ice shatters on the blow: it does not freeze or slow the target. Adds 1 Horror, hit or miss.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"damage","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"rimebound","cat":"magic"},
    {"id":"frostseal","tags":["bind"],"needs":"obstacle","name":"The Frozen Fastening","roll":"INT","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"close","use":"Action","does":"You breathe on a seam until it whitens. With an INT check, freeze one ordinary closed door, lid or shutter you touch until the end of the scene. Forcing it open is Hard (+3); sustained fire thaws it. It cannot repair a broken opening or reinforce a supernatural seal. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"rimebound","manualSteps":"GM tracks the frozen fastening, the Hard check and thawing; no automatic door state is changed."},
    {"id":"winterbreath","tags":["shelter"],"name":"Winter Breath","roll":"","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"close","use":"Action","does":"You blow across a cup the way you would cool soup, and the cold keeps coming. Cool up to one waterskin of liquid, or freeze a handful of water you touch. The ice lasts until it melts naturally. No check. It cannot freeze creatures, put out a large fire or deal damage. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"rimebound","manualSteps":"GM resolves the small change of temperature and when the ice melts."},
    {"id":"gravechill","tags":["daze"],"name":"The Grave Chill","roll":"WIS","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"near","use":"Action","does":"The cold of a fresh grave settles in a creature’s joints. A WIS check chills one creature in Close or Near. Its next DEX check is Hard (+3), ending unused at the start of your next turn. It does not stack with another Hard difficulty and deals no damage. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"lasttestament","manualSteps":"GM applies Hard to the next DEX check and removes it when used or expired."},
    {"id":"whitefootsteps","tags":["hide"],"needs":"obstacle","name":"White Footsteps","roll":"","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"near","use":"Action","does":"Hoarfrost creeps over footprints and smooths them away. Frost conceals the visible tracks of one willing creature in Close or Near until the end of the scene. It hides tracks already there and newly made tracks, not the creature, its sound or its scent. No check. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"winteroffice","manualSteps":"GM judges tracking and ends the concealment with the scene."},
    {"id":"frostcloak","tags":["shelter"],"name":"The Winter Shroud","roll":"","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"near","use":"Action","does":"A thin rime settles over a willing creature’s clothes, and the wind stops biting. Protect one willing creature in Close or Near from ordinary bad-weather cold until the end of the scene. No check. It gives no Defence, damage resistance or protection against spells. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"winteroffice","manualSteps":"GM accounts for environmental cold; no Defence or HP is changed."},
    {"id":"thunderknock","tags":["move"],"name":"Knock of Thunder","roll":"INT","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"near","use":"Action","does":"You rap your knuckles on the air and something answers with a dull boom. With an INT check, move one unattended object you can see within Near to another spot within Near. It must be small enough to lift with one hand. It cannot move a creature or a held or fastened object, or be used to attack. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"brokenbell","manualSteps":"GM checks size and eligibility and moves the object; no automatic token movement occurs."},
    {"id":"echobell","tags":["learn"],"name":"Echo of the Broken Bell","roll":"","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"near","use":"Action","does":"You strike a note on a cracked bell and listen to it come back. Learn the broad shape of the open space within Near, including obvious openings. No check. The echo cannot pass through closed doors or walls, tell you who is there or reveal hidden mechanisms. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"brokenbell","manualSteps":"GM describes the space; no map or hidden information is automatically revealed."},
    {"id":"laybones","tags":["shelter"],"name":"The Quiet Burial","roll":"WIS","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"close","use":"Action","does":"You press salt into a dead mouth and say the short burial office. With a WIS check, keep one unanimated corpse you touch from rising through a curse on the place until the end of the scene. This cannot stop a deliberate spell, dismiss an existing undead creature or restore life. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"lasttestament","manualSteps":"GM determines eligible corpses and tracks the protection until the scene ends."},
    {"id":"pactmark","tags":["learn"],"needs":"ally","name":"The Witness Mark","roll":"","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"close","use":"Action","does":"You prick a thumb, yours and theirs, and press them together. After you agree a single promise, mark one willing creature you touch. Until the end of the scene you know if it knowingly breaks that promise. No check. This does not compel obedience, read thoughts, punish the creature or create a servant. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"namelesspact","manualSteps":"GM and participant agree the promise, its breach and expiry; no automatic pact enforcement occurs."},
    {"id":"thornlash","name":"Thorn Lash","roll":"INT","effort":10,"horror":1,"band":"near","use":"Action","does":"A branch thick with thorns tears up out of the nearest earth and whips across. Make an INT check to strike one foe in Close or Near. On success roll Magic Effort d10 for damage. The branch withers after the blow and cannot be kept or sold. Adds 1 Horror, hit or miss.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"damage","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"rootbound","cat":"magic"},
    {"id":"rootgrasp","tags":["bind"],"needs":"wild","name":"Grasp of Roots","roll":"WIS","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"near","use":"Action","does":"Roots and stems twist round a creature’s ankles and pull tight. A WIS check makes existing living plants within Near catch one grounded creature they can reasonably hold. It may escape with an Action and a STR check against the scene Target; a Close ally can spend an Action to free it. The roots release at the start of your next turn. No damage. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"rootbound","manualSteps":"GM confirms plants and target size, tracks restraint, and resolves escape; movement and escape checks are manual."},
    {"id":"greenpath","tags":["move"],"needs":"wild","name":"The Green Passage","roll":"","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"near","use":"Action","does":"Bramble and undergrowth lean aside as you walk. Part living undergrowth within Near into a path wide enough for one person until the end of the scene. No check. It cannot open stone, timber walls or doors. The plants close again once the path is empty. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"rootbound","manualSteps":"GM describes or marks the path and its end; no terrain is automatically changed."},
    {"id":"beasttongue","tags":["beast","learn"],"needs":"animal","name":"The Beast Tongue","roll":"WIS","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"near","use":"Action","does":"You crouch low and speak in the grunts and whistles the book spells out. With a WIS check, ask one ordinary animal in Close or Near a question and understand its answer. It answers from its own senses and understanding. It need not be friendly or obey, and it cannot name things it does not know. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"thornantler","manualSteps":"GM plays the animal and decides what it knows; no creature control is granted."},
    {"id":"borrowedsenses","tags":["beast","learn"],"needs":"animal","name":"Eyes of the Beast","roll":"WIS","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"near","use":"Action","does":"You close your eyes and open an animal’s. With a WIS check, borrow the sight and hearing of one willing ordinary animal within Near until the start of your next turn. Your own sight and hearing are lost meanwhile. It ends if the animal leaves Near. You cannot command it or cast through it. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"thornantler","manualSteps":"GM describes the animal’s senses and tracks range and expiry; no automatic vision sharing or token control occurs."},
    {"id":"windcanticle","tags":["hide"],"needs":"obstacle","name":"Canticle of Small Winds","roll":"","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"near","use":"Action","does":"You hum the canticle, and the air leans the way you lean. Turn an existing ordinary breeze within Near until the end of the scene. No check. It can lift loose paper or carry smoke; it cannot push creatures, deal damage, carry anyone or change the weather beyond Near. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"thornantler","manualSteps":"GM resolves the breeze and ends the working with the scene."},
    {"id":"veilsteps","tags":["silence"],"needs":"obstacle","name":"The Unheard Step","roll":"","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"self","use":"Action","does":"You walk as the processional walks, heel to toe, and the ground forgets you. Your footsteps on ordinary ground make no sound until the start of your next turn. No check. This does not hide you, silence your gear or your speech, get you past traps or give a bonus to any check. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"silentcanticles","manualSteps":"GM judges whether other noises expose you and tracks expiry."},
    {"id":"shelter","tags":["learn"],"needs":"obstacle","name":"The Doorward","roll":"WIS","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"near","use":"Action","does":"You salt the threshold and say the Doorward over it. With a WIS check, ward one doorway within Near until the end of the scene. You sense when a living creature crosses it, but learn nothing of who or why. It cannot block anyone or cause harm. Only one of your Doorwards can stand at a time. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"seventhpenance","manualSteps":"GM tracks the doorway, replaces any earlier Doorward and announces crossings; there is no automatic alarm or vision reveal."},
    {"id":"cleanwater","tags":["shelter"],"name":"The Clear Cup","roll":"","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"close","use":"Action","does":"You hold the water up to the light and pray over it until it runs clear. Purify one waterskin of water you touch, removing ordinary dirt and ordinary poison. No check. It cannot cure a poison already swallowed, a disease or a supernatural taint, and it restores no HP. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"hospicewardbook","manualSteps":"GM resolves purification; this is not an automated healing action."},
    {"id":"safebed","tags":["shelter"],"name":"The Hospice Coverlet","roll":"","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"close","use":"Action","does":"You draw the coverlet’s psalm over a pallet as the hospice sisters do. Keep one bed space you touch free of ordinary vermin and dripping rain until the end of the scene. No check. It does not stop attackers, prevent damage, heal anyone or count as a party rest. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"hospicewardbook","manualSteps":"GM tracks the protected bed space and expiry; rest and HP are unchanged."},
    {"id":"vigilpsalm","name":"The Vigil Psalm","roll":"WIS","effort":6,"horror":0,"band":"close","use":"Action","does":"The psalm the night sisters say low over a sickbed, one hand on the brow. You, or one creature you touch in Close, heals Effort d6 HP. Each person can receive the Vigil Psalm once between party rests; this is separate from Mend, so a patient can have both. Healing adds no Horror.","heal":true,"fx":[{"on":"use","do":"heal","dice":"1d6","kind":"vigil","target":"target"}],"temptsHorror":false,"effect":"healing","from":"hospicevigil"},
    {"id":"snuffcandle","tags":["snuff"],"name":"The Snuffed Candle","roll":"","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"near","use":"Action","does":"You breathe out slowly, and every ordinary flame within Near gutters and dies: candles, lamps, torches, a hearth. No check. Magical fire and anything larger than a hearth fire keep burning. The flames can be lit again as normal. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"processional","manualSteps":"GM decides which flames go out and describes the dark; no light on the table changes automatically."},
    {"id":"unrememberedface","tags":["hide"],"needs":"obstacle","name":"The Unremembered Face","roll":"","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"self","use":"Action","does":"Your face becomes hard to hold in the mind, like a dream on waking. Until the end of the scene, anyone who sees you forgets your face as soon as you are out of their sight; they remember only that someone was there. No check. It does not hide you while you are seen, and it does not work on anyone who already knows you well. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"processional","manualSteps":"GM decides who knows you well enough to remember and tracks the scene."},
    {"id":"strangervoice","tags":["hide"],"name":"A Voice Not Your Own","roll":"","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"near","use":"Action","does":"The book speaks, but not from where you stand. A voice that is not yours says a few words, about one breath’s worth, from any point you choose within Near: a chimney, a doorway, the dark behind a guard. You choose the words and roughly how it sounds, but it cannot copy a particular person. No check. The GM decides who is fooled. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"unnamedbook","manualSteps":"GM plays the listeners’ reactions; no message or sound is sent automatically."},
    {"id":"blackice","tags":["bind"],"name":"Black Ice","roll":"INT","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"near","use":"Action","does":"The water in the ground darkens and turns to glass. With an INT check, a patch of ground within Near, big enough for a few people to stand on, becomes black ice until the end of the scene. A creature that crosses it, or starts its turn on it, makes a DEX check against the scene Target or falls. No damage. Fire or strong sun melts it early. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"mourningfrost","manualSteps":"GM marks the patch, calls for DEX checks and resolves falls; no movement or terrain changes automatically."},
    {"id":"forkedpsalm","name":"The Forked Psalm","roll":"INT","effort":10,"horror":1,"band":"far","use":"Action","does":"You lift the book to the sky, and the sky answers. Make an INT check against the scene Target to strike one foe you can see in Near or Far with lightning. On success roll Magic Effort d10 for damage. The flash and the thunder carry a long way: anyone nearby now knows where you are. Adds 1 Horror, hit or miss.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"damage","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"rivensky","cat":"magic"},
    {"id":"judgementclap","tags":["daze"],"name":"The Clap of Judgement","roll":"INT","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"close","use":"Action","does":"You strike your palms together in a foe’s face, and the air breaks like a thunderclap. With an INT check, one foe in Close is Dazed: its next attack rolls 3 less. No damage. Everyone within Near hears it. Adds 1 Horror.","fx":[{"on":"use","do":"status","tag":"dazed","target":"foe","until":"turn"}],"temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"rivensky","manualSteps":"GM applies Dazed to the foe’s next attack."},
    {"id":"palecandle","tags":["light"],"name":"The Pale Candle","roll":"","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"close","use":"Action","does":"A cold, blue-white flame settles on one metal point you touch: a blade’s tip, a spearhead, a weathervane. It lights Near until the end of the scene. It gives no heat, burns nothing, and goes out if the metal is covered. No check. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"rivensky","manualSteps":"GM tracks the light and when it ends; no light on the table changes automatically."},
    {"id":"ironhymn","name":"The Iron Hymn","roll":"INT","effort":10,"horror":1,"band":"near","use":"Action","does":"You sing one low note, and weight falls on a foe as if the sky had leaned on it. Make an INT check against the scene Target against one foe in Close or Near. On success roll Magic Effort d10 for damage. A flying or climbing creature that is hit is pressed to the ground; the GM decides where it lands. Adds 1 Horror, hit or miss.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"damage","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"lodestone","cat":"magic"},
    {"id":"lodestonepull","tags":["bind"],"needs":"person","name":"The Lodestone’s Pull","roll":"INT","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"near","use":"Action","does":"You hold out an open hand, and iron remembers where it was dug. With an INT check, one metal weapon or tool held by a creature in Near is torn from its grip and lands at your feet. The creature can hold on with a STR check against the scene Target. It cannot pull anything fastened down, worn as armour, or too big to carry in one hand. No damage. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"lodestone","manualSteps":"GM calls for the STR check and moves the item; no gear is moved automatically."},
    {"id":"heldbeam","tags":["bind"],"needs":"obstacle","name":"The Held Beam","roll":"INT","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"near","use":"Action","does":"You raise your hand, and something falling stops in the air. With an INT check, one falling or closing thing within Near, such as a gate, portcullis, beam or stretch of roof, hangs where it is until the start of your next turn, then carries on as it would have. It cannot hold up a creature or stop a blow. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"lodestone","manualSteps":"GM decides what can be held and what happens when it is released."},
    {"id":"oakenhide","tags":["guard"],"name":"The Oaken Hide","roll":"WIS","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"self","use":"Action","does":"Your skin roughens and greys like old bark, and it creaks when you move. With a WIS check you get +2 Defence until your next turn, but you can only walk, not run or climb, while it lasts. It does not stack with Ward. Adds 1 Horror.","fx":[{"on":"use","do":"buff","to":"defence","n":2,"target":"self","until":"turn"}],"temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"heartwood","manualSteps":"GM adds and later removes the +2 Defence and the slower movement."},
    {"id":"callwood","tags":["beast"],"name":"The Call of the Wood","roll":"","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"far","use":"Action","does":"You give the call the book teaches, a sound no throat should make. One ordinary wild animal within Far that can hear you comes and stays near you until the end of the scene. It is not tame: it will not fight for you or follow orders, and it flees if it is hurt. No check. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"heartwood","manualSteps":"GM chooses and plays the animal; no ally or token is created."},
    {"id":"hiddenleaves","tags":["hide"],"needs":"wild","name":"Hidden in Leaves","roll":"","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"near","use":"Action","does":"Leaf and shadow fold over one willing creature in Near that is standing among trees, hedges or tall grass. Until it moves or the scene ends, finding it by sight is Hard (+3). It does not hide sound or scent. No check. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"heartwood","manualSteps":"GM applies Hard to searches by sight and ends it when the creature moves."},
    {"id":"mistcall","tags":["hide"],"needs":"wild","name":"Mistcall","roll":"","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"near","use":"Action","does":"You breathe out under an open sky, and the ground breathes with you. Outdoors only, a thin, harmless fog rises and fills Near until the end of the scene. Inside it nobody can see beyond Close, and sounds seem to come from the wrong side. Unlike choking ash, it hurts nobody and cannot be called up indoors. No check. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"turningyear","manualSteps":"GM describes the fog and judges what can be seen; no vision on the table changes automatically."},
    {"id":"readsky","tags":["learn"],"needs":"wild","name":"Read the Sky","roll":"WIS","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"self","use":"Action","does":"You read the clouds, the birds and the smell of the wind as the book teaches. With a WIS check, learn what tomorrow’s weather will be and the safest way through the wild country you can see. It tells you nothing about people or monsters. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"turningyear","manualSteps":"GM gives the forecast and the route."},
    {"id":"harvestblessing","tags":["shelter"],"name":"The Harvest Blessing","roll":"","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"close","use":"Action","does":"You say the old harvest words over what is in your hands. Turn a handful of foraged roots, leaves or berries you touch into one day’s food for one person, or spoil one day’s worth of food or drink you touch. No check. It cannot affect poison, medicine or creatures. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"turningyear","manualSteps":"GM resolves the food; no supplies are added or removed automatically."},
    {"id":"bonesplinter","name":"Bone Splinter","roll":"INT","effort":10,"horror":1,"band":"near","use":"Action","does":"You snap a bone in your fist, and the pieces fly like shot. You must be holding a bone, any bone, and it is used up. Make an INT check against the scene Target against one foe in Close or Near. On success roll Magic Effort d10 for damage. Adds 1 Horror, hit or miss.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"damage","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"ossuary","cat":"magic","manualSteps":"GM checks that you have a bone to spend."},
    {"id":"raisedhand","tags":["move"],"name":"The Raised Hand","roll":"","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"close","use":"Action","does":"You lift one corpse’s hand with your own, and the rest of it follows. One unanimated corpse you touch rises stiffly and does one simple task you name, such as carrying, digging, pulling or holding a door, until the task is done or the scene ends. It cannot fight, speak or leave Near, and then it falls. Anyone who sees it knows it for what it is. No check. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"ossuary","manualSteps":"GM plays the corpse; no ally or token is created."},
    {"id":"countdead","tags":["learn"],"needs":"corpse","name":"Count the Dead","roll":"WIS","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"near","use":"Action","does":"You read the ossuary’s tally aloud and listen for the answers. With a WIS check, learn how many people have died within Near, and roughly how long ago: days, years or centuries. It gives no names and no causes. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"ossuary","manualSteps":"GM gives the count."},
    {"id":"gravegrip","name":"The Grave’s Grip","roll":"WIS","effort":10,"horror":1,"band":"close","use":"Action","does":"Your hand goes as cold as a grave, and you take hold. Make a WIS check against the scene Target against one living foe in Close. On success roll Magic Effort d10 for damage. It does nothing to the dead or undead; the GM confirms the target is living. Adds 1 Horror, hit or miss.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"damage","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"sextonlitany","cat":"magic","manualSteps":"GM confirms the target is living."},
    {"id":"sextonbell","tags":["daze"],"needs":"undead","name":"The Sexton’s Bell","roll":"WIS","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"near","use":"Action","does":"You ring the small bell sextons ring over a new grave. With a WIS check, one undead foe in Near is Dazed: its next attack rolls 3 less. No damage. To the living it is only a bell. Adds 1 Horror.","fx":[{"on":"use","do":"status","tag":"dazed","target":"foe","until":"turn"}],"temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"sextonlitany","manualSteps":"GM confirms the foe is undead and applies Dazed to its next attack."},
    {"id":"shroud","tags":["hide"],"name":"The Borrowed Shroud","roll":"","effort":0,"horror":1,"band":"close","use":"Action","does":"You draw the shroud’s psalm over a willing creature you touch, and the life goes out of its face. It seems dead, with no breath, no warmth and no pulse, until it moves or the scene ends. It can still hear. No check. The GM decides who is fooled. Adds 1 Horror.","temptsHorror":true,"effect":"esoteric","horrorReason":"Casting forbidden magic tempts the Horror, whether the spell succeeds or fails.","from":"sextonlitany","manualSteps":"GM decides who is fooled; no HP or condition changes."}
